  (text "POWER MUX - U1/U2 TPS2116, priority mode (MODE = VIN1)\nVIN1 = powerboard (after eFuse), VIN2 = USB side. VREF 0.92 / 1.00 / 1.08V, no built-in hysteresis.\n  U1 5V:   R1/R2 100k/33k + R58 1M from ST  -> ~3.80V falling / 4.13V rising\n  U2 3V3:  R3/R4 100k/68k + R60 1M from ST  -> ~2.24V falling / 2.57V rising\n  The eFuse UVLO (U8 4.29V, U9 2.80V) normally drops VIN1 before PR1 does.\nST is open-drain (R57/R59 pull-ups): PWR_SRC_5V -> PA2, PWR_SRC_3V3 -> PA3. High = powerboard.\nR45 100k holds VBUS at 0V with no cable (50uA).\nU3 AP7361C-33E: 1A LDO, 360mV dropout. USB-only is still bench use (F1 500mA PTC).\nFirmware: when ST is low (USB power) keep the radio and DotStars off."
    (at 33.02 279.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "33aeffb7-fe6d-407a-afd3-78d429793d54")
  )
  (text "J1 POWERBOARD CONNECTOR - JST-XH 8P\n  1-2 +5V   3-4 +3V3   5-6 GND   7 PWR_UART_TX   8 PWR_UART_RX\n  UART4 115200 (PA0/PA1), 3.3V, R46/R47 1k series. Pin 7/8 order to confirm with powerboard.\n5V:  Q1 reverse polarity -> D9 TVS -> U8 TPS259631 eFuse -> +5V_PB\n3V3: D10 TVS -> U9 TPS259631 eFuse -> +3V3_PB  (no series FET, saves ~0.15V at 1.5A)\neFuse (TI SLVSET8A): OVLO and UVLO trip at 1.2V on the pin, ILIM = 909/RILM, 22nF dVdt = 2V/ms.\n  U8: OVLO 5.60V, UVLO 4.29V, ILIM 1.5A      U9: OVLO 3.66V, UVLO 2.80V, ILIM 2.0A\n  FLT wired-OR with R52 pull-up -> PWR_FAULT (PA4). TPS259631 = auto-retry.\nQ1: D = input, S = load, G to GND via R43. D11 10V zener clamps Vgs (AO3401A abs max +/-12V)."
    (at 156.21 279.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4b1552b3-3242-4a29-b6dd-2625ec5fa8e0")
  )
  (text "LIMITS\n1. U9 OVLO 3.66V (+/-2%) keeps +3V3 under the STM32 4.0V abs max; U8 OVLO 5.60V under TPS2116 6.0V.\n2. TPS2596 ILIM max is 2.0A. A 3V3 budget above ~1.8A needs a higher-current eFuse.\n3. D9/D10 are surge/ESD only (VBR 7.5V / 5.4V); the eFuse OVLO does the overvoltage cut-off.\n4. 3V3 drop at 1.5A: U9 ~0.15-0.21V + U2 ~0.08V. Powerboard 3V3 should be >= 3.4V (radio min 3.0V)."
    (at 156.21 252.73 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f4e8f7a3-c3fe-4805-ac33-ea59b8304ea5")
  )
  (text "ROUTING - POWER INPUT\nJ1 -> Q1/D9/D10 -> U8/U9 -> U1/U2: 2A traces, >=1.0mm on 1oz outer (or pours).\nU8/U9 thermal pad to a GND pour with vias. R51/R56 right at the ILM pins.\nD9/D10 right at the rail, short wide GND via. C1/C2/C7 at TPS2116 VIN, C3/C8 at VOUT.\nU3 tab to a copper pour. R46/R47 near J1, UART pair away from the power pours."
    (at 90.17 68.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 255 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4eb9f006-ad9e-464c-9bec-1c277fd5ecb2")
  )
